+```text
+Model data version: 2026-10-28.1 (bundled)
+Source URL:         https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IronbellyOrg/IronClaude/master/src/superclaude/skills/ccsession-tag/ccsession-models.json
+Cache:              /tmp/e01/cache/ccsession/models.json
+Last check:         never
+Profiles:           claude, gpt, grok, muse, wonderfull, wonder, qwen, glm
+Tier mode:          on (settings from /tmp/e01/defaults.sh); tiers: tier0, tier1a, tier1b, tier2, tier3, tier4
+Access:             owner unknown starts on tier2; tiers: tier2, tier3, tier4 (CCSESSION_TIER_RULES, *)
