+
+- `bundled` and `never`: the empty throwaway cache leaves the copy shipped with the skill in use (`models.py:129-131,228-239`; `ccsession-models.json:2-3`). With no owner name, only the `*` entry of `CCSESSION_TIER_RULES` applies, because it was meant to limit exactly such a terminal (`models.py:530,557-562`; `README.md:320-321`).
